達のイラストを格納させていただきます。お手隙の際にご確認の程、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E5R11tKcpvQkzmP17xOTSIiblIqL52AS\n\nシナリオのネタバレなどありますので、早見表を見る際はお気をつけください。\n\nもしなにか不都合な点などありましたら、再送をお願いいたします。どうぞご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mnnvspw_66/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2709977, "client_id": 995364, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1284142335203278849%2FypcwgiWw.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b683d9579663faa52df5b53fe1b158d1", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1284142335203278849%2FypcwgiWw.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b683d9579663faa52df5b53fe1b158d1, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1284142335203278849%2FypcwgiWw.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e42e21a481aeb8c1b8a7986bc74698 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1284142335203278849%2FypcwgiWw.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5883015b5f1267b075d80352c279216c 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/d4a97cd6-69c3-4a26-b2d4-5a86dc9d167b?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774630433&Signature=FYLw9d-V4QcSNQ8B4xUrN3C0iU36RjFMb9XidXURfBqip8rFgxsFNAb0rux8chWpesVuUD1oQsufp2eUs8H9v9J8Nd4HZngqMljH78sb2efePB-1dxA6QqDbF82MZPdacWLq5iYU-JhzCTYHEn8sX~48ynikr7DjfupsebYf-bXw88IsyRIDkCH~Yg1~nuLtJkWlOxMNTt9ODg9AhoWeoJtrP-c72leBoLvQakBo~kN7qLiPEYN2NvC9yXLiLM6QFFCa5Sc~rRqmfpwVK6OVxPjAkRy4I6yPlwNJCiFIl7qldASFj1P4AueioORtCpO56CGeCiPpaUHQcVfv0PcT~g__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "duration": 158, "nsfw": false, "h